      "headline": "Strategic Leadership | DevOps | SecOps | Reliability Engineering | AIOps | DataOps | Digital Transformation | Platform Engineering | Hybrid Cloud | IoT | Service Delivery and Operations | ",
      "about": "I am a senior technology and platform leader with a strong foundational background in technology and engineering, and over a decade of experience leading large-scale DevOps, DevSecOps, and platform transformations across Education & Research, Retail, Pharma, Telco, Media, Insurance, and Smart Metering sectors.\n\nMy career spans Platform Engineering, DevOps & DevSecOps, Cloud Infrastructure, CI/CD automation, Software Engineering, Container Orchestration, and Enterprise Integration, with a proven track record of modernising complex, legacy estates into secure, scalable, cloud-native and SaaS-based platforms.\n\nI specialise in building and operating enterprise-grade DevOps and platform capabilities across SaaS, PaaS, and IaaS, delivering both greenfield and hybrid cloud solutions at scale. My approach is grounded in engineering excellence, with a strong focus on automation, security-by-design, reliability, observability, and developer productivity.\n\nAlongside hands-on technical leadership, I operate at a senior strategic level, partnering closely with CIOs, executive leadership, security, architecture, finance, and delivery functions. I bring deep expertise in governance, financial and vendor management, risk and compliance, operating models, and multi-year transformation roadmaps, ensuring technology investments deliver measurable organisational outcomes.\n\nI am highly experienced in Agile, SAFe, and product-led delivery models, and have led multi-million-pound transformation programmes across complex and regulated environments. My leadership style is collaborative and people-centred, with a strong emphasis on capability building, mentoring, inclusive leadership, and creating high-performing engineering cultures.\n\nCurrently, I serve as Head of DevOps at University College London (UCL), where I lead the DevOps Transformation Programme across CI/CD platforms, DevSecOps tooling, cloud platforms, observability, secrets management, and developer enablement—supporting one of the UK’s largest and most diverse digital estates across teaching, research, and professional services.\n\nI hold multiple industry certifications across DevOps, Agile, Programme & Service Management, am a Chartered Manager (FCMI), and an alumnus of Imperial Business School, having completed the Senior Leaders Apprenticeship Programme—strengthening my ability to bridge deep technical expertise with modern, strategic leadership.\n",
